            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Collaboration with Actors and Composers</strong><br>\nSpielberg's collaborations with actors like Tom Hanks and Harrison Ford have led to some of the most memorable performances in cinema. His long-standing partnership with composer John Williams has also resulted in iconic film scores.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Impact on Popular Culture</strong><br>\nSpielberg's films have had a lasting impact on popular culture, influencing everything from filmmaking techniques to theme park attractions. His ability to connect with audiences has made him one of the most successful filmmakers in history.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ongoing Work and Legacy</strong><br>\nSpielberg continues to direct and produce films, with a keen interest in both historical topics and futuristic narratives. His legacy includes not just a collection of films but also a significant impact on the craft of filmmaking and the movie industry.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
